---
// Portfolio / Showcase Component
---
<section id="portfolio" class="py-28 border-t border-slate-900 px-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-16">
        <div>
            <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-emerald-400 mb-3">Verified Track Record</h2>
            <p class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">Featured client implementations.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm max-w-md mt-4 md:mt-0">
            A cross-section of enterprise software systems, brand architectures, and growth pipelines engineered by SebTech.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <!-- Project 1 -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800/85 hover:border-slate-700 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group">
            <div>
                <div class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400 mb-3">FINTECH INFRASTRUCTURE</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Nexus Core Platform</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
                    Full-stack re-architecture and high-concurrency payment routing engine processing $50M+ monthly transaction volume with zero downtime.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="pt-6 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
                <span class="text-slate-500">Next.js / TypeScript / AWS</span>
                <span class="text-emerald-400 font-medium">View Metrics &rarr;</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Project 2 -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800/85 hover:border-slate-700 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group">
            <div>
                <div class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400 mb-3">BRAND & UI/UX SYSTEM</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Veloce Cloud Identity</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
                    Complete re-branding, design system creation, and enterprise web application frontend for a fast-scaling analytics platform.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="pt-6 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
                <span class="text-slate-500">Design Systems / React</span>
                <span class="text-emerald-400 font-medium">View System &rarr;</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Project 3 -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800/85 hover:border-slate-700 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group">
            <div>
                <div class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400 mb-3">CLOUD DEVOPS & SEO</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Aether Logistics Portal</h3>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
                    Automated CI/CD container pipeline migration coupled with technical SEO restructuring that accelerated organic lead acquisition by 240%.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="pt-6 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
                <span class="text-slate-500">Docker / Python / CRO</span>
                <span class="text-emerald-400 font-medium">View Impact &rarr;</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>